    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.23,
      "end_seconds": 168.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "Hmm I'm on warfarin 3 milligrams in the evening for the blood thinning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.74,
      "end_seconds": 179.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.52,
      "end_seconds": 184.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "An irregular heartbeat for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.72,
      "end_seconds": 207.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.33,
      "end_seconds": 211.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "no, nothing as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.96,
      "end_seconds": 217.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "let me get the readings out of the way"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.43,
      "end_seconds": 233.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.57,
      "end_seconds": 259.88,
      "duration_seconds": 15.31,
      "text": "Okay: BMI works out to 33.3 heart rate 78. And height 157 centimetres weight 82 kilos pressure 151 over 100 saturation 96 percent temp 36.6 degrees respiratory rate 16."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.18,
      "end_seconds": 262.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.54,
      "end_seconds": 267.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it soon"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.06,
      "end_seconds": 273.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.19,
      "end_seconds": 276.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.56,
      "end_seconds": 299.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "your right face droops, your right arm is weak and your speech is slurred"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.33,
      "end_seconds": 313.07,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "alright, you can relax now so, based on the history and the examination, this is probably a possible stroke, within the treatment window"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.7,
      "end_seconds": 317.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "erm will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.7,
      "end_seconds": 349.43,
      "duration_seconds": 31.73,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned but right now a possible stroke, within the treatment window is my leading thought not anything worse. An urgent CT scan of the head is what I'd like next for possible stroke. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Let's get a blood sugar test for stroke symptoms. Call an ambulance now you need hospital immediately."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.83,
      "end_seconds": 360.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.4,
      "text": "I'd like you to see the stroke team as well, and I'll write the referral. Do get help quickly if the symptoms change."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.89,
      "end_seconds": 362.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Alright, I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.27,
      "end_seconds": 366.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "see me again straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.66,
      "end_seconds": 371.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Actually, I'll note it in my calendar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 373.48,
      "end_seconds": 377.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
